# Requiting Hex: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may blight 1. Destroy target creature with mana value 2 or less. If this
# spell's additional cost was paid, you gain 2 life." To blight 1 is to put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control (CR 701.68a): Bot1's
# Ornithopter (0/2) takes it, so it is a -1/1 and survives, and the counter is on Bot1's creature, not on Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which
# is destroyed by the spell itself. The cost was paid, so Bot1 gains 2 life. The twin that declines the cost is
# "...without-blighting-destroys-the-creature-and-gains-nothing".

